    Add evaluation terms (imbalance, rook/passer, space, long diagonal, weak queen, weak unopposed pawn, king-pawn distance), cutoff-count LMR and material correction tunables, time-management tunables
    
    Co-authored-by: couns0538-sketch <couns0538-sketch@users.noreply.github.com>

